  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoding with avgpool aggregation in a multiprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 (F1 0.5727). The result is lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (config_005: 0.6501), suggesting the RNA encoder may influence performance. However, the exact contribution of the encoder versus other factors remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence and potential confounding variables from the multiprofile setting."
}

